  "worked_solution": "We count the number of rectangles. We see that there is $1$ rectangle.\n\n We count the total number of shapes. We see that there are $6$ shapes in total.\n\nSo the ratio of rectangles to the total number of shapes is $\\frac{1}{6}.$",
